  expr_varargs_err_value.pcpp - break step of expr_varargs.pcpp:
  a bare varargs used as a value (SM0421)

  How to check, from repo\bin:
    pcpp res\tests\expr_varargs_err_value.pcpp
    pcpp res\tests\expr_varargs_err_value.pcpp -t x86_64-linux-gnu
  The marked line reports that code; nothing else is reported.
*******************************************************************************/

module exe expr_varargs_err_value;

routine V(...);
begin
  println("{}", varargs); // ERROR SM0421@17: 'varargs' is not a value
end;

begin
  V(1);
end.
